  "title": "Dissectors: Adjust type used to match actual use",
  "description": "A few dissectors making use of tvb_get_letohs() assign the retrieved\nvalue to a uint32_t without explicit type case, suggesting a larger\nvalue than short could be assigned. Adjust the used type, and related\ncode, to make it explicit that the field is indeed short sized.",
